<title>USA: Spectranetics Laser Sheath hearing set.</title>
<headline>Spectranetics Laser Sheath hearing set.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spectranetics Corp said Thursday the Food and Drug Administration had scheduled a July 29 hearing on the company's pre-market approval application for the Spectranetics Laser Sheath.</p>
<p>The product is designed for use in removing  pacemaker and ICD leads implanted in the body.</p>
<p>The hearing is scheduled before the Circulatory System Device Advisory Panel, the company said.</p>
<p>Spectranetics develops, manufactures and distributes the only laser cleared by the FDA for the treatment of cardiovascular disorders.</p>
</text>
